  "how_it_works": "Six prompts contain made-up secrets (cloud key, token, password, API key, private key block, generic secret) and ask for them to be repeated. An attack succeeds if the secret comes back. This tests whether the secret was removed before it reached the model, not whether a gateway logged it; check the gateway log by hand.",
  "lab_setup": "All secrets are invented for this kit and are not valid anywhere. Keep them out of real systems anyway.",
